name: Checked context copies retain spending, exact selection and explicit work approval
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_accounting.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: use sast
submit: options sast:scan
submit: set taskMode manual
submit: set tasks secret-scan
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | first-form
keys: Down Down Down Enter Down Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Alpha · regeneration draft | generated-copy
keys: d
require-live-snap: 25 Labeled regeneration | compared-copy
expect: Before:
expect: After:
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | comparison-back
keys: c
require-live-snap: 30 Enter inspects the saved check | checked-copy
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_accounting.py @TMP_TARGET @ART checked
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | inspected-check
expect: Alpha · regeneration draft
keys: m
require-live-snap: 30 RESULT READY | pending-map
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_accounting.py @TMP_TARGET @ART pending
ask: Does checking the inactive regenerated copy require inspection and explicit Map acceptance, while keeping the original, globally active context and single recorded request intact?
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 Map ✓ | accepted-map
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_accounting.py @TMP_TARGET @ART accepted
keys: Escape
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 25 1 committed / 5 total | inherited-spending
expect: 2 protected review
expect: 3 passes · 1 worker
keys: Down Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 20 revision 1 | budget-details
resize: 160x48
live-snap: budget-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: budget-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: budget-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: budget-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: budget-40x12
keys: z
require-live-snap: 20 ┌ Total calls | narrow-budget-reader
keys: End
live-snap: narrow-budget-tail
ask: Are consumed calls, protected Review capacity, unknown dollars and separate work approval readable across six viewport sizes without losing the selected context?
keys: Escape
resize: 120x36
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 Draft ready | three-pass-draft
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_accounting.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW PLAN & ALLOWANCE | review-new-work
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 y approve | approval-tail
expect: 3 fixed jobs
keys: y
require-live-snap: 25 APPROVED STUDY | approved-new-work
expect: 1 committed / 5 total
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_accounting.py @TMP_TARGET @ART approved
ask: Does approving three new jobs preserve the earlier context request and limits while leaving execution as a separate action?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 3 job(s) · 3 planned | recovered-campaign
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 APPROVED STUDY | recovered-study
expect: 1 committed / 5 total
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_accounting.py @TMP_TARGET @ART recovered
keys: Escape
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_accounting.py @TMP_TARGET @ART damage
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 25 cannot be authenticated | damaged-origin
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_accounting.py @TMP_TARGET @ART damaged
keys: Escape
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_accounting.py @TMP_TARGET @ART repair
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 25 1 committed / 5 total | repaired-origin
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_accounting.py @TMP_TARGET @ART repaired
ask: Does restart retain approved but unstarted work, refuse damaged spending provenance without starting fresh accounting, and recover the same budget after the exact receipt is restored?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
